Package: locationchoicedatajp
Title: Open Data for Location Choice Models in Japan
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Mizuki", "Uchida", , "uchidamizuki@vivaldi.net", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides reproducible pipelines that build analysis-ready
    tables for estimating household and firm location choice models in
    Japan from open data published by the national government. Data are
    not bundled: they are downloaded from the primary sources and built on
    demand by 'targets' pipelines bundled with the package, and cached via
    'tarchives'.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/UchidaMizuki/locationchoicedatajp,
    https://uchidamizuki.github.io/locationchoicedatajp/
BugReports: https://github.com/UchidaMizuki/locationchoicedatajp/issues
